# shell/widgets — the widget extension point (ticket 06).
#
# One predictable directory. Adding a widget = copy a file in here, add one
# line to WidgetRegistry.qml's `entries`, add one line below. Nothing else.
#
# A qmldir disables Quickshell's synthetic qmldir for its directory, so every
# type here must have a line (scripts/verify-widget-contract.sh asserts this).
# Note the `import "."` these files use to reach each other resolves only
# because this file exists — without it, sibling types are unresolvable.
BarWidget BarWidget.qml
SimpleBarWidget SimpleBarWidget.qml
ClockWidget ClockWidget.qml
VolumeWidget VolumeWidget.qml
CpuWidget CpuWidget.qml
MemoryWidget MemoryWidget.qml
BatteryWidget BatteryWidget.qml
BluetoothWidget BluetoothWidget.qml
PlayerWidget PlayerWidget.qml
Launcher Launcher.qml
Workspaces Workspaces.qml
Tray Tray.qml
NotificationWidget NotificationWidget.qml
singleton WidgetRegistry 1.0 WidgetRegistry.qml